nd="00:20.370">no </span><span begin="00:20.370" end="00:20.850">one </span><span begin="00:20.850" end="00:21.240">hears </span><span begin="00:21.240" end="00:21.360">you </span><span begin="00:21.360" end="00:22.380">screaming</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.530" end="00:25.290"><span begin="00:22.530" end="00:22.800">No </span><span begin="00:22.800" end="00:22.920">you </span><span begin="00:22.920" end="00:23.280">don't </span><span begin="00:23.280" end="00:23.550">know </span><span begin="00:23.550" end="00:23.910">what </span><span begin="00:23.910" end="00:24.150">it's </span><span begin="00:24.150" end="00:25.290">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.470" end="00:28.110"><span begin="00:25.470" end="00:25.710">When </span><span begin="00:25.710" end="00:26.220">nothing </span><span begin="00:26.220" end="00:26.700">feels </span><span begin="00:26.700" end="00:28.110">alright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.290" end="00:33.240"><span begin="00:28.290" end="00:28.440">You </span><span begin="00:28.440" end="00:28.800">don't </span><span begin="00:28.800" end="00:29.100">know </span><span begin="00:29.100" end="00:29.460">what </span><span begin="00:29.460" end="00:29.730">it's </span><span begin="00:29.730" end="00:30.420">like </span><span begin="00:30.420" end="00:30.540">to </span><span begin="00:30.540" end="00:30.750">be </span><span begin="00:30.750" end="00:31.230">like </span><span begin="00:31.230" end="00:33.240">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.270" end="00:34.620"><span begin="00:33.270" end="00:33.510">To </span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:34.020">be </span><span begin="00:34.020" end="00:34.620">hurt</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.650" end="00:36.000"><span begin="00:34.650" end="00:34.890">To </span><span begin="00:34.890" end="00:35.370">feel </span><span begin="00:35.370" end="00:36.000">lost</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.030" end="00:38.790"><span begin="00:36.030" end="00:36.270">To </span><span begin="00:36.270" end="00:36.750">be </span><span begin="00:36.750" end="00:37.140">left </span><span begin="00:37.140" end="00:37.470">out </span><span begin="00:37.470" end="00:37.680">in </span><span begin="00:37.680" end="00:38.100">the </span><span begin="00:38.100" end="00:38.790">dark</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.820" end="00:40.110"><span begin="00:38.820" end="00:39.060">To </span><span begin="00:39.060" end="00:39.510">be </span><span begin="00:39.510" end="00:40.110">kicked</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.140" end="00:41.460"><span begin="00:40.140" end="00:40.500">When </span><span begin="00:40.500" end="00:40.920">you're </span><span begin="00:40.920" end="00:41.460">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.490" end="00:44.220"><span begin="00:41.490" end="00:41.670">To </span><span begin="00:41.670" end="00:41.880">feel </span><span begin="00:41.880" end="00:42.360">like </span><span begin="00:42.360" end="00:42.600">you've </span><span begin="00:42.600" end="00:42.840">been </span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:43.350">pushed </span><span begin="00:43.350" end="00:44.220">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.340" end="00:47.640"><span begin="00:44.340" end="00:44.580">To </span><span begin="00:44.580" end="00:45.180">be </span><span begin="00:45.180" end="00:45.510">on </span><span begin="00:45.510" end="00:45.750">the </span><span begin="00:45.750" end="00:46.260">edge </span><span begin="00:46.260" end="00:46.350">of </span><span begin="00:46.350" end="00:47.040">breaking </span><span begin="00:47.040" end="00:47.640">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.670" end="00:50.100"><span begin="00:47.670" end="00:47.910">And </span><span begin="00:47.910" end="00:48.150">no </span><span begin="00:48.150" end="00:48.450">one's </span><span begin="00:48.450" end="00:48.990">there </span><span begin="00:48.990" end="00:49.080">to </span><span begin="00:49.080" end="00:49.680">save </span><span begin="00:49.680" end="00:50.100">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.250" end="00:53.820"><span begin="00:50.250" end="00:50.520">No </span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:50.640">you </span><span begin="00:50.640" end="00:51.000">don't </span><span begin="00:51.000" end="00:51.330">know </span><span begin="00:51.330" end="00:51.690">what </span><span begin="00:51.690" end="00:51.930">it's </span><span begin="00:51.930" end="00:53.820">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.660" end="00:57.330"><span begin="00:54.660" end="00:55.500">Welcome </span><span begin="00:55.500" end="00:55.710">to </span><span begin="00:55.710" end="00:56.160">my </span><span begin="00:56.160" end="00:57.330">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.560" end="01:01.410"><span begin="00:58.560" end="00:58.800">Do </span><span begin="00:58.800" end="00:58.980">you </span><span begin="00:58.980" end="00:59.280">wanna </span><span begin="00:59.280" end="00:59.460">be </span><span begin="00:59.460" end="01:00.270">somebody </span><span begin="01:00.270" end="01:01.140">else</span><span begin="01:01.140" end="01:01.410">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.410" end="01:04.170"><span begin="01:01.410" end="01:01.590">Are </span><span begin="01:01.590" end="01:01.710">you </span><span begin="01:01.710" end="01:01.980">sick </span><span begin="01:01.980" end="01:02.070">of </span><span begin="01:02.070" end="01:02.400">feeling </span><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.640">so </span><span begin="01:02.640" end="01:03.090">left </span><span begin="01:03.090" end="01:03.990">out</span><span begin="01:03.990" end="01:04.170">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.170" end="01:06.990"><span begin="01:04.170" end="01:04.350">Are </span><span begin="01:04.350" end="01:04.470">you </span><span begin="01:04.470" end="01:05.160">desperate </span><span begin="01:05.160" end="01:05.490">to </span><span begin="01:05.490" end="01:05.880">find </span><span begin="01:05.880" end="